//scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uKpjQCM-9PcQ7kNvwG2i4uW&_nc_oc=AdpXdEfFwHaK8aK-fI3ruARaeFaD8JvZX5SnH4Y8IH3qyQ2K1XHOdEWf-YldiPDDI1o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR4MGtZi0MvxlpFk1Rz4oRg2p1emyD0B_ZUNvAPwsvHKw&oe=6B0DB260"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jNGllXN6iK4Q7kNvwG9LqLV&_nc_oc=AdqpGoYTyRH-q8d15hjQe2hl8J5AABNuuzMrvZr8y9M4OmZqeqj4F7IsvRy5T2yBTq8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQShhDXWLnfODc6VUTfxWHazwwJoFFCRqCKTikzRAn2AKA&oe=6B0DBBE2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XQ81s8SRqLQQ7kNvwH-5wLW&_nc_oc=AdpxQej2qjVj2-vLPmalLqA8mm8b6_MOoKcj2XFY3tWlGLfc5Uofi64CcWA-2GMuFyQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ7TQUJPN3d32F3VcKdEQmhjMhTPPnZskfd0ouAlKvfQA&oe=6B0DAA81"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=alTkwyvZqQQQ7kNvwFfrCAj&_nc_oc=Adp1P7IQFfd7g-mw9jlcBvp3RXFFoIlXMV57oLd96GQBowOiW_hDi8g3eko0Z0ANar0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRnRVc1MZjy1vRzl4Frit_sn9bASOiJUWNjJ-e9yym5Bg&oe=6B0DD0D2"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/terms", "publisher_name": "Nebulytic", "support_website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/support", "website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/", "category": null, "c